The Art of Computer Programm, Phextified
----------------------------------------
This phext provides worked examples and commentary on the Art of Computer Programming. It is assumed that you have a copy of Donald Knuth's volumes to refer to.

The material presented here has been upgraded for the 21st century, to include phext where applicable. If you need a phext-capable editor, try the links below.

Phext Notepad: https://github.com/wbic16/phext-notepad
Phext Library (Rust): https://github.com/wbic16/libphext-rs
Phext Library (Node): https://github.com/wbic16/libphext-node

Preface
-------
I started this path on April 22, 2025. For me, 1975 is either 10 years ago (Back to the Future, Top Gun era), or 50 years ago (present day). My notes make use of modern amenities, such as large language models, ChatGPT, Google, terabytes of disk space, and gigabytes of RAM. Phext was born in the midst of our transition to AI-powered development.

